  "title": "Markov traces on degenerate cyclotomic Hecke algebras",
  "authors_raw": "DEKE ZHAO",
  "title_lines": [
   "MARKOV TRACES ON DEGENERATE CYCLOTOMIC HECKE ALGEBRAS"
  ],
  "abstract": "Let Hn(u) be the degenerate cyclotomic Hecke algebra with parameter u = {u1, . . . , um}. The paper aims to define and construct the (non-)normalized Markov traces on the sequence {Hn(u)}\u221e n=1. This allows us to provide the Brou\u00b4e\u2013Malle\u2013Michel symmetrizing trace on Hn(u) and show that the Brundan\u2013Kleshchev trace is a specialization of the non-normalized Markov traces on Hn(u).",
